From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 09:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 05/11] feat(guest): reuse native CDH for retained encrypted volumes

Use released CDH SecureMount only for embedded-header encrypted devices.
Bind disks and keys to measured workspace policy, initialize only through
the measured stock-cryptsetup helper, and enforce readonly at every layer.
Track and roll back only resources acquired by this call.

Signed-off-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>
---
